      en: ["Krn reaches an elevation of 2244 meters above sea level.", "Lake Krn is located at an altitude of 1391 meters and is up to 18 meters deep.", "The summit was captured by Italian Alpini troops in June 1915.", "The Gomišček Lodge (Gomiščkovo zavetišče) stands just below the peak.", "The western face of Krn has a vertical drop of nearly 400 meters.", "The mountain is primarily composed of organogenic Dachstein limestone."],
